// CotSC Batch 18 - extracted original English dialogue for PWYUP.d
// Keep existing @ numbers stable when translating.
@1 = ~Did you know adding scorpion's poison to a Vauge Tea is recommended to cure potassium deficiency?~
@2 = ~What?~
@3 = ~Having pink-skinned hands is better than having no hands at all.~
@4 = ~B-but...~
@5 = ~I once fell in love with a goblin named Crock Pliersarm. He drowned in a lake of salt during apocalypse which destroyed the whole world and I was teleported here under a fake name to lead this world onwards and protect it from army of giant talking potatoes.~
@6 = ~Make sure to brush your teeth before sleep or more teeth will grow underneath your armpits.~
@7 = ~Looks like this one lost touch with reality even worse than our Minsc had.~
@8 = ~If you're staying at Purple Wyrm Inn sleep with one eye open. Lady that stayed the night yesterday got robbed blind while she was asleep. She lost a pair of bracers, some gemstones and gold. Pickpockets are everywhere these days.~
